<title>USA: Roche unit files new HIV drug formulation.</title>
<headline>Roche unit files new HIV drug formulation.</headline>
<dateline>NUTLEY, N.J. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoffmann-La Roche Inc, a unit of Roche Holding Ltd, said on Monday that it has submitted a New Drug Application to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for a new form of its HIV protease inhibitor saquinavir mesylate.</p>
<p>The new formulation provides eight to nine times the drug exposure of the current formulation, the company said.</p>
</text>
